Explosives now set off other explosives.

1) A TNT blast sets off everything else armed in the room.
   - Mines on the floor, traps on the doors, traps on the portals.
   - Grenades are not included; they answer only to their own fuse.

2) Door traps have always damaged the room on the far side.
   - A chain that follows them into the next room does the same.
   - It can carry up to eight rooms from the original charge.

3) Nothing can set itself off twice.
   - Doors and portals disarm on both sides before they deal damage.
   - Mines spend a charge first.

See HELP TRAPS.
